{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20492","headline":"和令狐尚书平泉东庄近居李仆射有寄十韵 · 张籍","name":"和令狐尚书平泉东庄近居李仆射有寄十韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平地有清泉，伊南古寺边。\n涨池闲遶屋，出野徧浇田。\n旧隐离多日，新邻得几年。\n探幽皆一绝，选胜又双全。\n门静山光别，园深竹影连。\n斜分采药径，直过钓鱼船。\n鸡犬还应识，云霞顿觉鲜。\n追思应不远，赏爱谅难偏。\n此处堪长往，游人早共传。\n各当恩寄重，归卧恐无缘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20492.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20492","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}